```rust
pub struct DBClient {
    connection_string: String,
}

impl DBClient {
    // Clones string inputs to avoid lifetime annotations on the struct.
    pub fn new(conn: &str) -> Self {
        Self {
            connection_string: conn.to_string(),
        }
    }
}
```

fix:
Accept owned types directly (`String`, `Vec<T>`), allowing callers who already own the data to move it without allocation, or use `impl Into<String>` / `Cow<'static, str>`.
```rust
pub struct DBClient {
    connection_string: String,
}

impl DBClient {
    pub fn new(conn: String) -> Self {
        Self { connection_string: conn }
    }
}
```
